  "fps": 30,
  "materials": {
    "videos": [
      {
        "id": "40448cc3-a9d4-4044-8781-de99123f6f00",
        "path": "E:\\代码\\美食街\\live-cutter\\recordings\\16-44-50_东方甄选_p001.mp4",
        "type": "video",
        "duration": 3600000000,
        "width": 1080,
        "height": 1920
      }
    ],
    "texts": [
      {
        "id": "c22ecd57-699c-4a87-a056-80cc0685d813",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那麼大東京的六點多上早自行那個叫不冷\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "dbfd1278-4994-4d67-aefe-feefff3cc757",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"穿他 大人早上起了七點多七點多上吧\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "30a96486-921f-453b-b05c-99323832e7f1",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"你的叫不冷穿他老人穿著他跳舞打太極\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "b550ae77-197d-45df-83e0-2eb4ba24e2fc",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"都沒有任何的問題\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "c774c6be-8dd0-41c0-8a82-1211df6a226b",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"而再來我們整個的前面能夠\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "e3d686d7-efda-42f8-85f7-22027e536abb",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"給您做到一個防破水的一個設計特別舒服\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "6f5b1d5c-520b-4741-8e12-04f39797f91c",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"特別省事\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "44763e13-2aa3-4fb1-b139-721cb190cb79",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"被方下學南方下雨對吧\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "f9d5613e-4a0a-4391-a6a8-d9dc34713c88",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"移到了東天那個整個地面全部都引用\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "997b9bcb-f278-4181-b73f-36f36e94c2e3",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"我們這個打看一下表面髒話說怎麼辦\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "58013312-fa36-4b58-a2df-8a71041b3f7f",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"有點你了 有點土了怎麼辦\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "50a28db7-70c2-42fa-94b6-a07970ef8382",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"沒關係 用水一沖又止一擦\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "e2a6e97f-7475-4d8d-8059-92d81c3fa1e0",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"簡簡單單非常好打理 不費罵也不費罵\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "24290d89-980c-4348-8a3e-1fdadd9c65c2",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那張康照 哪怕你去殺空裡面\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "370e70db-ddb6-476d-92b4-943b9e8442e3",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"哪怕你去土堆裡面走路\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "f372356e-1951-482e-aaf6-91fc37a28bea",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"咱都不怕那個狀態\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "d95f4d4d-33de-4bb1-9e2c-f26498458ac4",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"而且重點還在於防滑\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "446805b4-f8c4-46bc-b948-56e2e758f2ba",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"那啥零零零零零零零天來說\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "7f8c6246-1136-4b67-b65f-8dac75b6b99c",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"尤其是評論去前面你要給老人買的\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "dc3491c8-8729-4403-9b9e-f933e2adcd43",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"一定要關注防滑滑\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "acb9041e-c2f5-46dd-84d0-b7704ba66186",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"這是一個塑料寶而非常滑\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "bb0703db-a9a4-4613-89f0-167ffc570c75",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"來給你按一下整個的鞋底非常滑的一個大地\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "8be3274c-e623-4471-8c93-4955b6107295",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"看過去45度的鞋波塑料寶\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "8b8461e1-abff-49cd-a945-e5e65546ee71",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"非常滑 熟大一個點在那邊放上去了這種\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "bdf95cc9-cf39-4061-826b-24cebd0e3ae9",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"文問當當\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "f52c8998-6c7f-4691-b8e0-2bcc594e0397",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"您走路的時候咱不打滑\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "afa9ebfa-834d-4384-8630-9ddb076cb141",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"咱也不容易睡覺 再不容易白覺\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      },
      {
        "id": "e3cde51a-26e4-4ca9-b54d-3ab99e88c234",
        "content": "{\"text\": \"您都沒有任何之科技能都超過死\"}",
        "font_size": 8.0,
        "text_color": "#FFD700",
        "border_color": "#000000",
        "border_width": 2.0,
        "type": "subtitle"
      }
    ],
    "speeds": [],
    "transitions": []
  },
